    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of classic survival horror.\u00a0Explore cramped corridors and unsettling urban environments as you figure out the reason behind a citywide outbreak. Collect resources, manage a limited inventory, and of course, battle your way through groups of zombies. Gunplay is deep and becomes more varied with each new weapon you acquire. Stagger a monster with a well-timed shot and exploit weaknesses to emerge victorious. Combat is precise, but rewarding for those who master it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of classic survival horror.\u00a0Explore cramped corridors and unsettling urban environments as you figure out the reason behind a citywide outbreak. Collect resources, manage a limited inventory, and of course, battle your way through groups of zombies. Gunplay is deep and becomes more varied with each new weapon you acquire. Stagger a monster with a well-timed shot and exploit weaknesses to emerge victorious. Combat is precise, but rewarding for those who master it.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pulsebreaker is a classic survival horror game. Explore environments, collect resources, and fight zombies. Manage your inventory, solve light puzzles, and survive with limited supplies. Includes melee and ranged combat. Single-player only.",
